 ('check','How to check your strikes','<p>Open TikTok, go to your inbox for violation messages, and look in Settings and privacy for the account status section, where TikTok lists recent violations on accounts that have it. Appeal any you think are wrong; each successful appeal removes a strike.</p>'),
